     "@en": "**Scusarsi** (apologize): **Senza scusarsi** (without apology)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Es un verbo reflexivo: **mi scuso** (me disculpo).",
     "@en": "It is a reflexive verb: **mi scuso** (I apologize)."
    }
   ]
  },
